  "info": {
    "description": "Simulated short-interest and securities-lending data vendor: snapshots, history, screens, exchange-reported short interest, daily file, watchlist alerts, OpenFIGI-shaped mapping.\n\n**Simulator for demonstration only. Not affiliated with or endorsed by EquiLend, Wematch, FIS, S3 Partners or Bloomberg; all names are trademarks of their respective owners. Listed instruments come from public reference data (OpenFIGI, Yahoo Finance); lending data, counterparties and trades are synthetic.**",
    "title": "Market Analytics (S3-style) \u2014 mock-analytics",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
